{"id": 151433557, "slug": "the-new-new-deal-the-pu-pu-platter", "title": "The New New Deal: The Pu Pu Platter", "subtitle": "aka the \"Official Policy Platform\"", "post_date": "2024-11-09T23:05:34.344Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 415, "reaction_count": 12, "comment_count": 4, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 12}, "body_html": "<p>The Republic stands. (For now...)  </p><p>Amazing.  </p><p>As Wayne and Garth used to say\u2026\u201d<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HpkecYVRt_E\">Game on!</a>\u201d</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fffa9a574-202d-40ba-893e-8d4c4bea7683_2172x1172.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fffa9a574-202d-40ba-893e-8d4c4bea7683_2172x1172.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fffa9a574-202d-40ba-893e-8d4c4bea7683_2172x1172.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fffa9a574-202d-40ba-893e-8d4c4bea7683_2172x1172.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fffa9a574-202d-40ba-893e-8d4c4bea7683_2172x1172.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-7th!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_pro